window.EN={"1":"Having obtained the \"Sword of Seals,\" Roy and the others turn their army toward Bern's royal capital.","2":"There waits the opponent Roy and the others must defeat—","3":"the very mastermind who started this great war,","4":"Bern's King Zephiel, who should be lying in wait leading Bern's formidable royal guard.","5":"Roy and the others press on, straight for Bern's royal capital,","6":"in order to bring an end to this long war, and to bring back a peaceful day to the continent once more...","7":"I see... so Murdock has fallen, has he...","8":"...I regret it deeply.","9":"...How do things stand with the Etrurian army's movements?","10":"After subjugating the \"Shrine of Seals,\" it's said they're heading this way.","11":"I see... Then let us meet them in battle here, at this royal palace.","12":"Yes, sir. My arm itches for it.","13":"No, Brunnya. There's something I need you to do instead.","14":"Eh...","15":"Idoun. Idoun, are you there?","16":"...Before you, my lord.","17":"I will meet the Etrurian army in battle here.","18":"You are to escape from here. Hide yourself away until the fighting is over.","19":"...If that is what Your Majesty commands.","20":"Brunnya. You are to protect Idoun and escape from here.","21":"Th-that can't... please, let me fight alongside Your Majesty too!","22":"No. ...This battle will be a harsh one. I cannot afford to lose Idoun here.","23":"Otherwise, this war—my fight—will become something without meaning.","24":"But, Your Majesty! I... I...","25":"Enough, Brunnya. This is a royal command!","26":"Or are you telling me that you cannot obey this command of mine!","27":"No, I would never...","28":"Idoun. Even should I fall... you understand, don't you.","29":"Yes... just as Your Majesty has commanded, I will show you the world's \"liberation.\"","30":"Good. The dream I saw does not end here.","31":"So long as you do not die, my dream will go on living—forever.","32":"Yes.","33":"The Etrurian army... so it's finally come, has it.","34":"We won't let you lot through to His Majesty... to the \"Throne Room.\"","35":"No matter what, I will see to it that this \"mechanism\" is defended!","36":"So this is... Bern's royal palace...","37":"Lord Roy, Bern's King Zephiel","38":"is said to be in the central part of this place, the \"Throne Room.\"","39":"However, it seems this castle's \"Throne Room\" has a special","40":"\"mechanism\" installed, for times when it comes under attack.","41":"What kind of thing is it?","42":"According to what we drew out of a Bern prisoner,","43":"there are \"mechanisms\" in the inner chambers on both sides of the royal palace,","44":"and it's said you must first disarm the \"mechanisms\" on both sides.","45":"That's quite a detour, isn't it...","46":"There's more still.","47":"After that, you must hold up the \"jewel\" to the door of the \"Throne Room.\"","48":"When you do that, it's said the final mechanism releases, and the door opens.","49":"The \"jewel\"? I wonder if that means the \"Fire Emblem.\"","50":"Most likely.","51":"In that case, I'm already carrying it right now.","52":"So all I have to do is head straight for the throne, then...","53":"That would surely be the quickest way.","54":"...But still, would he really so easily tell us such important information...?","55":"Could it be a trap set by the enemy...?","56":"No, that fellow also said this:","57":"\"Those places are guarded by formidable men.\"","58":"\"Even if you lot find out, there's nothing you can do about it,\" he said.","59":"...Whether we can or can't, we won't know until we try.","60":"The ones guarding it might be tough opponents, but","61":"we won't lose either!","62":"※If it's a male unit","63":"So this is it... a \"mechanism,\" you say, but there's nothing special here...","64":"※If it's a female unit","65":"So this is it... a \"mechanism,\" you say, but there's nothing special here...","66":"So you've come... hmph, to think a mere boy like you would dare stand in my way.","67":"Bern's King Zephiel...","68":"There's one thing... I want to ask. Why did you invade other nations!","69":"...In order to put an end to a world ruled by men.","70":"...What did you say?","71":"People are ugly.","72":"They sway toward whoever's strongest, and casually betray those they've trusted up until then.","73":"You too must have been made to suffer, time and again, by those who betrayed you, haven't you?","74":".........","75":"Jealousy, envy, resentment...","76":"Swayed by such trivial emotions, kin and comrades turn on each other,","77":"and out of love for oneself, a father is born who would lay hands on his own son.","78":"As long as man rules man, as long as man stands above man, such things will never end.","79":"But—","80":"What you yourself are doing is precisely a man ruling over men, is it not!","81":"...You know how the \"Scouring\" ended, don't you.","82":"The tale that your ancestor, the hero Hartmut, defeated the \"Dragon-Devil\"...","83":"That was a mistake.","84":"A mistake?","85":"Man should never have won. Because man won, this world came to be ruled by man,","86":"and became an ugly thing, swayed by trivial emotions.","87":".........","88":"Mistakes must be corrected swiftly.","89":"I will hand the world over to the \"dragons.\"","90":"I will \"liberate\" the world from man's rule, and redo everything from after the Scouring once more.","91":"Th-then, is it true that you're the one who revived the \"Dragon-Devil\"?","92":"Who knows. Why don't you confirm that for yourself.","93":"...You just said you'd hand the world over to the \"dragons,\" but that just means men are replaced by dragons!","94":"But the \"dragons\" that have been revived are vessels made for fighting...","95":"those have no \"self.\"","96":"A world ruled by them will become a fair and quiet one.","97":"I don't think that would make for a good world at all!","98":"It's true, people are led astray by all sorts of petty thoughts, but","99":"isn't it people, too, who overcome them!","100":"Hmph... pretty words.","101":"I believe in the possibility of people!","102":"I will never lose to you, who have despaired of people and denied even yourself!!","103":"I won't let the likes of you stand in my way!","104":"Mmgh... so I... lose...","105":"But remember this...","106":"My conviction... was not what lost here...","107":"As long as man rules over man... tragedy will... repeat itself...","108":"※If you have all 8 Divine Weapons (not whether you picked them up, but whether all have been used at least once)","109":"So this is the Bern king's end...","110":"Lord Roy, you've done it.","111":"...It may be too soon to celebrate.","112":"What do you mean by that?","113":"What's that supposed to mean?","114":"The figure of the one called the \"Priestess of Darkness\" is nowhere to be seen...","115":"Hm, so it seems she's gotten away.","116":"...I see.","117":"Whoa! Wh-what is this?","118":"King Zephiel's sword just... glowed!","119":"If I recall, its name was...","120":"\"Eckesachs\"...","121":"A sword that, it's said, only Bern's king is permitted to use...","122":"Th-that reminds me, in one account of the \"Scouring\" legend,","123":"...the \"Divine Weapons\" wielded by the Eight Generals—","124":"when they all gather together in one place, the Shrine of Dragons shall appear...","125":"there was something like that, I believe.","126":"The Shrine of Dragons...","127":"It's said to have been the home base of the dragons, in the age of the \"Scouring.\"","128":"I do believe... I recall reading something like that...?","129":"Yes, that's how the legend has it.","130":"Then, is \"Eckesachs\" the final \"Divine Weapon\"?","131":"I had thought Hartmut used the \"Sword of Seals.\"","132":"...Perhaps the \"Sword of Seals\" is something other than a \"Divine Weapon\"...","133":"It may be an existence that surpasses even that...","134":"...Something that surpasses even the \"Divine Weapons\"... just what is the power of the \"Sword of Seals\"...?","135":"Oh! It's glowing again!","136":"This time, the light is stretching out, in a streak, toward the south!!","137":"Does this mean the Shrine of Dragons lies at the end of this light?","138":"If we consider that the legend's \"shall appear\" points to that location,","139":"then that would be so.","140":"...If the \"Priestess of Darkness\" really is the \"Dragon-Devil\"...","141":"then the chances she's there are quite high, I'd say...","142":"Understood. Let's go—to the Shrine of Dragons!","143":"※If you don't have all 8 Divine Weapons"};
